From: Turner Linux Port <turner@localhost>
Subject: [RFC PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: mediatek: describe MT6991 GPU PLL blocks

Each block exposes one GPUFreq-managed PLL at index zero.

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8196-sys-clock.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8196-sys-clock.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,9 @@
     items:
       - enum:
           - mediatek,mt6991-apmixedsys
+          - mediatek,mt6991-mfgpll-pll-ctrl
+          - mediatek,mt6991-mfgpll-sc0-pll-ctrl
+          - mediatek,mt6991-mfgpll-sc1-pll-ctrl
           - mediatek,mt6991-topckgen
           - mediatek,mt6991-vlpckgen
           - mediatek,mt8196-apmixedsys
